nMy main focus for this version was completely killing those annoying FPS drops and making sure the aimbot actually sticks to the head without spazzing out or shaking. It’s highly optimized.\n\nFeatures:\n\nSticky Aimbot (RMB): Right-click to lock on. I added a custom deadzone and velocity prediction (0.045). It predicts where they are going, locks on smoothly, and doesn't shake when it reaches the head. Wallbang is supported.\n\nDynamic ESP: Boxes, Skeletons, Health bars, and Distance. The ESP is color-coded using raycasts: Red = behind wall, Green = visible, Cyan = currently locked target.\n\nTeam Check: Universal team check is enabled for both ESP and Aimbot so you don't snap to your own teammates.\n\nZero Lag Scanner: I removed the constant GetDescendants spam. It only scans when a new character actually spawns in, so your FPS stays maxed out.\n\nLite-Fullbright: Removes shadows and fog without deep-frying your screen into pure white.\n\nModal Cursor Fix: If you play games that force mouse-lock (like Frontlines, Arsenal, etc.), my custom UI bypasses it so you can actually click the menu buttons without your mouse getting stuck.","tags":["esp","radar","aimbot","fov"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/hZDD6GPt","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"69996e323c999592ac9eb137","username":"HumanoidPremium","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4adc16ca600a48f0d69d8b1317a81c8029f9c27533f411cbbbec1da34bc57901.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69996e323c999592ac9eb137-1776404299001.png"},"lvl":14,"status":"offline","id":"69996e323c999592ac9eb137","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":25},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4adc16ca600a48f0d69d8b1317a81c8029f9c27533f411cbbbec1da34bc57901.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69996e323c999592ac9eb137-1776404299001.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":